use firn/tags

bubblewrap is a Module
bubblewrap is tagged cli-tools

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.bubblewrap.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.bubblewrap]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."bubblewrap"."enable": enable "Enable bubblewrap sandbox (north readonly-shell requires bwrap)"
